      MaskType      "PWM (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Space-vector PWM with the minimum-phase-error (MPE) or the minimum-magnitude-error (MME) overmodulation (PWM), with the duty-ratio error model d_err = InverterNonlinearity(t_d, u_th, sign) and its compensation, the minimum pulses, and the single update. The blocks inside are its methods compute_output and get_realized_voltage. In standby of the control system (the input standby nonzero), the realized voltage is unknown (NaN), so the observers run on their open-circuit model, as in get_feedback of the control system."
