      MaskType      "CurrentVectorController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current-vector controller (CurrentVectorController). The configuration cfg is a struct with the fields of CurrentVectorControllerCfg ([] = None, i.e., the default; the offline reference generation and k_f = [] only). The parameters are passed to the blocks inside it, as CurrentVectorController, and the SpeedFluxObserver resolves the defaults of create_speed_flux_observer. The inputs u_c_lim_ab (the limited voltage reference of the PWM) and enable (the gate enable) are used by the direct discrete-time current controller. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, L_d, L_q, and psi_f of SynchronousMachinePars, or n_p, R_s, and psi_s_dq_fcn (a GradNet flux map) of SaturatedSynchronousMachinePars."
